   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Existence of a national system for data collection, measurement and analysis to monitor progress towards the Sustainable Development Goals and Development Cooperation Framework (DCF).</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">No formal SDG monitoring and reporting system in place
DCF document endorsed and available (not action plan)</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">-	Support provided for development of SDG Roadmap including publication and dissemination
-	Development of National Strategy for Development of statistics (NSDS) is finalized
-	Development of National statistics Policy is finalized
-	At least one National conference on production and use of data for sustainable development is conducted
-	At least 4 awareness dialogue sessions on SDG and MKUZA III are organized in four different districts
-	Support provided to develop and disseminate various SDG and MKUZA III IEC materials aiming at raising awareness 
  on the subject matter</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project successfully facilitated the development of SDG Roadmap which has been publicized too, for this reporting period a National Strategy for Development of statistics (NSDS) and National statistics Policy were finalized including a National conference on production and use of data for sustainable development was conducted involving different stakeholders.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Coordinated and gender sensitive M&amp;E framework for SDGs, FYDP III, MKUZA III established 
- FYDP III and its associated frameworks finalised and launched 
- SDGs, FYDPs, EAC Vision 2050, and Africa Agenda 2063 data Visualization and dissemination portal for Tanzania 
 established 
- 15 LGAs trained about Local Economic Development (LED) Framework and development of LED strategies Regions and 
 LGAs
- THDR 2021 for Mainland prepared with the theme: Financing for Development
- Two Strategic Dialogue meetings between DPs and Government undertaken to foster development cooperation in 
 Tanzania 
- Three sector level dialogues focusing on health, education and water undertaken</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1	Mainstreaming of SDGs/ and AU 2063 indicators and targets into FYDP III M+E framework and assessment of SDGs/ FYDP III data gaps and sec tor data for Unmapped SDGs indicators 
1.2	Finalize the popular version of the Zanzibar Medium Term Strategy 2021-2025 
1.3	Develop popular version of Zanzibar vision 2020-2050
1.4	Support the development of the TDV 2050 (Visioning team meetings, consultations, drafting process) 
1.5	Capacity building on methodologies, guidelines and standards of SDGs including developing metadata for SDGs including developing metada for SDGs FYDP III to implying mainstreaming process 

2.1 Further analysis of 2020/2021 ILFS dataset to extract indicators the reflect the needs of SDGs 
2.2 Supporting the Development and compilation of relevant data, for SDG Goal Track Dissemination Portal to track progress of SDGs/ FYDP Implementation 
2.3 Support finalization of Zanzibar Medium Term Development Strategy (MTDS), M&amp;E framework 2021-2025

4.1 Finalization and launch of the THDR 2021/2022 and preparation of the THDR (Mainland and Zanzibar) 2022/23 

5.1 Facilitate capacity building to external Finance officers on new and diverse development finance sources and how to leverage resources from the diverse sources 
5.2 Review and develop Zanzibar new resources mobilization guideline on project planning and negotiations 
5.3 Facilitate capacity building for External Finance officers Zanzibar
5.4 Undertake Strategic Dialogue Meetings between DPs and Government 
5.5 Undertake sector dialogue on Land, Tourism Environment youth and Media sector/ Thematic areas 
5.6 action dialogue at LGAs level</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
    </period>
